<http://data.silknow.org/object/047dc98c-b86f-3c76-b6bf-e9fc1a41a1db>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Brocaded in polychrome silks.  Symmetrical design of two alternating arrangments of leaves and flowers branching out from the center in a wide, curved, V-shaped form.  Connected on each side motifs interspersed with rosettes.  Selvedge on both sides of six cords and two narrow stripes.  Spotted and soiled.  One end made up of a group of fragments pieced together to continue the pattern. Repaired in several places with embroidery."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/ad72eaee-a90b-3f1c-affb-111d124e508a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Brocaded in polychrome silks.  Symmetrical design of two alternating arrangments of leaves and flowers branching out from the center in a wide, curved, V-shaped form.  Connected on each side motifs interspersed with rosettes.  Selvedge on both sides of six cords and two narrow stripes.  Spotted and soiled.  One end made up of a group of fragments pieced together to continue the pattern. Repaired in several places with embroidery."@en ;
